        "h": 32,
        "latex": "C_{\\theta}\\left(M,V,b_{w},d\\right)\\coloneq\\mathrm{if}\\left(N_{Ed}<0\\,\\mathrm{kN},\\max\\left(1,\\min\\left(\\frac{1}{\\tan\\left(\\theta_{CSA}\\left(\\varepsilon_{x}\\left(M,V,d\\right)\\right)\\right)},C_{opt}\\left(a_{V}\\left(b_{w},d,V\\right)\\right)\\right)\\right),C_{opt}\\left(a_{V}\\left(b_{w},d,V\\right)\\right)\\right)",
